{
  "controlWidth" : 12,
  "label" : "TextBlock1",
  "text" : "<div style=\"font-size: 15px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 200px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8;\">\n<p><strong>Apologise to the customer: </strong></p>\n<p><strong>If customer believes there is not enough branch staff serving:</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&ldquo;I&rsquo;m sorry to hear you&rsquo;ve had that experience.&rdquo;</p>\n<p>AND</p>\n<p>&ldquo;I understand your frustration. Resourcing can be tricky. We monitor customer demands in branch, but we can&rsquo;t always predict this accurately. We will continue to review how we can resource appropriately to meet our customer demands.&rdquo;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>If customer unhappy about removal of teller service:</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&ldquo;I&rsquo;m sorry this change has been frustrating for you.&rdquo;</p>\n<p>AND</p>\n<p>&ldquo;We have seen that over time our customers are using digital banking, and our over-the-counter transactions have decreased significantly. Would you like me to talk you through some other options to do your banking?&rdquo;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Acknowledge concern:</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&ldquo;Thank you for raising this with us. I&rsquo;ve recorded your concerns and this will be considered as part of our internal review.&rdquo;</p>\n</div>",
  "show" : {
    "group" : {
      "operator" : "AND",
      "rules" : [ {
        "data" : "Not enough branch staff",
        "condition" : "=",
        "field" : "ApologiseBranchQueue:TalkTrackApologise:selectedButtonName"
      } ]
    }
  },
  "dataJSON" : false,
  "HTMLTemplateId" : "",
  "textKey" : "",
  "sanitize" : false
}

{
  "customAttributes" : [ {
